12. Take a screenshot of the report.

TO UPLOAD A TEST FILE

1. Open VirusTotal.
2. Click File.
3. Select Choose file.
4. Select a harmless test file.
5. Click Open.
6. Wait for the scan to finish.
7. Observe the detection results.
8. Take a screenshot.

RESULT:
The file was successfully analysed using VirusTotal
and its detection results were displayed.
